dentifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The part-list identifies the different musical parts in this document. Each part has an ID that is used later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the musical data. Since parts may be encoded separately and combined later, identification elements are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present at both the score and score-part levels. There must be at least one score-part, combined as desired","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with part-group elements that indicate braces and brackets. Parts are ordered from top to bottom in a score","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the order in which they appear in the part-list.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPartList","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLPartList"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartList/Item/partGroup(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/Item\/partGroup(_:)","abstract":[{"text":"The part-group element is defined within a group due to its multiple uses within the part-list element.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist\/item\/partgroup(_:)","kind":"symbol","title":"MXLPartList.Item.partGroup(_:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"partGroup","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartGroup","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL12MXLPartGroupV"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartGroup":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartGroup","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLPartGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartgroup","title":"MXLPartGroup","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLPartGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The part-group element indicates groupings of parts in the score, usually indicated by braces and brackets.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Braces that are used for multi-staff parts should be defined in the attributes element for that part. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"part-group start element appears before the first score-part in the group. The part-group stop element appears","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"after the last score-part in the group.","type":"text"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLPartList/Item":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlpartlist\/item","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLPartList\/Item","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Item","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"One of the alternatives for PartList.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Item","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLPartList.Item"}}}